Maintainer: Somanos Sar <somanos.sar@drumee.com>
Standards-Version: 1.0.1
Homepage: https://drumee.com

Package: drumee-static
Architecture: all
# No component dependencies, and no build tooling.
#
# This package is an asset tree served by nginx: it has no maintainer script, nothing
# it runs, and nothing it reads from another component. It depended on drumee-infra
# (and on binutils/nodejs/git, left over from build time) because on a single box
# everything depended on everything, and the metapackage installs the whole set
# regardless — so the declaration cost nothing there and was never questioned.
#
# It costs a great deal in the container channel: drumee-role-web asks for
# ui-pod + static + nginx and resolved to 508 packages, every Drumee component
# included, because static dragged in drumee-infra and ui-pod dragged in
# drumee-server-pod. The role image then failed to BUILD, because drumee-infra's
# postinst correctly refuses to configure without an answered domain — a package
# that must not be installed at image build time at all.
#
# What guarantees a complete native install is the `drumee` metapackage, which pins
# every component at an exact version (meta/make-control.sh); what orders the service
# start is drumee-server-pod's dpkg trigger. Neither needs these Depends.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Drumee Static Files
